  "fullDescription": "A warm botanical junk journal kit featuring watercolor greenery, eucalyptus accents, and vintage handwritten textures.\n🌿 Soft Botanical Watercolor Aesthetic\nImmerse your creative projects in a gentle blend of watercolor leaves, warm green tones, and aged paper textures. Each page feels organic, nostalgic, and perfect for storytelling.\n\n📜 Vintage Handwritten Backgrounds\nEach page blends subtle antique script with soft botanical illustration, creating a timeless and romantic atmosphere ideal for journaling and collage work.\n\n🖨️ Easy Printing & Resizing\nPrint two pages per sheet on US Letter to create perfect Half Letter journals\nFully compatible with A4 — select “Fit to Page” in printer settings\n\n📦 WHAT’S INCLUDED\n\nBotanical watercolor pages\nVintage handwritten backgrounds\nEucalyptus and greenery accents\nHigh‑resolution 300 DPI\nUS Letter & Half Letter formats\nSignature format included\n\n⭐ PRODUCT SUMMARY\nThis set includes 30 Half Letter pages and 30 US Letter pages, plus 15 US Letter Signature pages, all at 300 DPI resolution, featuring a warm botanical watercolor theme with vintage handwritten textures. Designed for easy printing and resizing for junk journals, scrapbooks, stationery, and nature‑inspired creative projects.\n\n🌿 CREATIVE IDEAS FOR USE\n🖼️ FRAME AS ART – botanical prints, greenery illustrations\n📓 JUNK JOURNALS – focal pages, backgrounds, botanical spreads\n📚 SCRAPBOOKS – cohesive layouts with soft watercolor textures\n✉️ STATIONERY – writing paper, envelopes, pockets\n📦 DECOUPAGE – albums, wooden boxes, notebook covers\n✂️ BULLET JOURNALS – monthly themes, habit trackers, dividers\n✨ FUSSY CUT ELEMENTS – leaves, labels, botanical accents",
